          "prompt": "=Instructions:\n--------------\n{{ $json.textPlain }} ,  give me a clean JSON extraction based ONLY on the variables listed below and create an UID based on {{ $json.date }} in ddmmyyyy format and add a number behind starting from 1 , check using excel tool if current UID exit in excel tool , if yes +1 to current UID. Read up on the details of the workflow then give any solution you can think of to digitalize the workflow\n\n***ALWAYS check column A in \"Excelsheets\" for current UID , if current UID exist, current UID +1***\n\nUID\nName \nDepartment\nRequest Type\nTime taken to complete task \nSource Data\nDeliverables\nDetails of the workflow \nSolution to digitalize the process\n--------------\nCompletion:\n***AFTER check column A in \"Excelsheets\" for current UID , if current UID exist, current UID +1***\n\n--------------\n{completion}\n--------------\n\nAbove, the Completion did not satisfy the constraints given in the Instructions.\nError:\n\nthe UID exist in the excel but AI did not increase by 1 for current UID\n***ALWAYS check column A in \"Excelsheets\" for current UID , if current UID exist, current UID +1***\n\n--------------\n{error}\n--------------\n***ALWAYS check column A in \"Excelsheets\" for current UID , if current UID exist, current UID +1***\n\nPlease try again. Please only respond with an answer that satisfies the constraints laid out in the Instructions: give me a clean JSON extraction based ONLY on the variables listed below and create an UID based on {{ $json.date }} and check using excel tool if current UID exit in excel tool , if yes +1 to current UID. Read up on the details of the workflow then give any solution you can think of to digitalize the workflow\n\n***ALWAYS check column A in \"Excelsheets\" for current UID , if current UID exist, current UID +1*** . \n\nUID\nName \nDepartment\nRequest Type\nTime taken to complete task \nSource Data\nDeliverables\nDetails of the workflow \nSolution to digitalize the proces